# Ignore virtual environments
**/.venv/
**/.venv_linux/
**/venv/
**/env/

# Ignore node modules and build artifacts
**/node_modules/
**/frontend/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/frontend/.next/
**/frontend/out/
**/frontend/build/

# Ignore local data and database files
**/data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.csv
**/*.tsv
**/*.gz
**/*.pkl
**/*.pth
**/*.onnx

# Ignore logs and temp files
**/*.log
**/*.out
**/*.tmp
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.hypothesis/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/

# Ignore IDE and OS files
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Ignore git
**/.git/
**/.gitignore

# Ignore build-related
**/docker-compose.yml*
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
**/Makefile

# Ignore plans and docs
**/plans/
**/docs/
**/AI-Best-Practices/
**/PERFORMANCE_PROTOCOL.md
**/SECURITY_PROTOCOL.md
**/README.md
**/walkthrough.md
**/task.md
**/implementation_plan.md

# Keep the bootstrap movie dataset available to the backend image.
!data/
!data/movies.csv

